# Cloudflare Pages redirects. Read from the output root at deploy time.
#
# /favicon.ico is the one icon path that is not ours to choose. Browsers request it
# on their own when a page declares no icon, and so do some link-preview and feed
# tools. Every page here does declare its icons, so nothing in the site depends on
# it, but the file moved into icons/ on 2026-07-30 and a bare request would now 404.
# One line is cheaper than finding out which tool cared.
/favicon.ico  /icons/favicon.ico  301
